    "summary": "Bearer: a **THOUSAND SONS** model.\n\nWhile wholly within the [Flow of Magic](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.hexwarp-thrallband.flow-of-magic) of your army, the bearer's unit gets these benefits:\n\n- the bearer's [Psychic abilities](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities) that state a range, Rituals included, can get +6\" range\n- you can re-roll any [Hazardous](vsdata:core-rule/hazardous) test that one of the unit's models takes for a [Psychic weapon](vsdata:core-rule/psychic)",
